1825	1896	1822	1823	the visitor	498	“ I should be incapable of so dishonorable an action . I know that a lawyer gets credit for possessing but lax notions on the score of honor , but you can scarcely suspect that I should be guilty of underhand work toward you . I never was guilty of a mean trick in my life , to my recollection , and I do not think I ever shall be . ”
