232389	232476	232241	232242	Richard Hare	144	“ Partially so . My father and mother were displeased , naturally , at my intimacy with Afy Hallijohn ; therefore I did not care that they should be cognizant of my visits there . I am ashamed to confess that I told my father a lie over it that very evening . He saw me leave the dinner - table to go out with my gun , and inquired where I was off to . I answered that I was going out with young Beauchamp . ”
