232490	232583	232241	232242	Richard Hare	144	“ No . I took my gun , for I had promised to lend it to Hallijohn while his own was being repaired . When I reached the cottage Afy refused to admit me ; she was busy , and could not , she said . I felt sure she had got Thorn with her . She had , more than once before , refused to admit me when I had gone there by her own appointment , and I always found that Thorn ’s presence in the cottage was the obstacle . ”
