232637	232703	232241	232242	Richard Hare	144	“ I loved her with an honorable love , as I might have done by any young lady in my own station of life . I would not have married her in opposition to my father and mother ; but I told Afy that if she was content to wait for me until I was my own master I would then make her my wife . ”
